@authorizationToken = 102739e42dcbd5a71559d05e264698539cc089a041421a3f9e99dfa40e69410d
@photoId = 6a3b40eed7b90edf07d29438
@orderId = pega-aqui-el-id-del-pedido

### POST - Crear pedido (usuario logueado)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{authorizationToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "photos": ["{{photoId}}"]
}

###

### GET - Ver mis pedidos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{authorizationToken}}

###

### GET - Ver un pedido por id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authorizationToken}}

###

### GET - Ver todos los pedidos (solo admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{authorizationToken}}

###

### PATCH - Actualizar estado (solo admin)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authorizationToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "paid"
}